Tests ability to design a real-time, multi-modal ICA pipeline under practical automotive constraints (latency, nonstationary noise, sensor dropout) and to justify design choices across whitening, demixing, and model order.

## Key Concepts
- Online whitening using incremental PCA
- Convolutive ICA across 64 channels and 4 sources
- Per-bin demixer sizing and real-time updates
- Cross-modal permutation consistency
- Model-order selection for unknown source counts
- Ground-truth-based on-device evaluation (SDR/SIR)

